ote-mutation rule. Inspect failed-job logs and return changes_requested for fixable test/code failures; blocked for actual capability/permission/allowance problems. Do not rerun CI, bypass checks or approve failed/cancelled checks without resolving the cause. Return approved only with no actionable findings and passing checks; otherwise changes_requested with concrete file/behavior findings, or blocked for a capability limitation.",
